orts are one bit unless otherwise\nspecified.\n\n - input  clk\n - input  d   (8 bits)\n - output q   (8 bits)\n\nThe module should include 8 D flip-flops. All DFFs should be triggered by\nthe positive edge of clock.\n\n\n\nCANDIDATE RTL TO ATTACK:\n```verilog\nmodule TopModule (\n    input clk,\n    input [7:0] d,\n    output [7:0] q\n);\n\n    // Declare 8 D flip-flops\n    reg [7:0] d_reg [0:7];\n\n    // D flip-flop always block\n    always @(posedge clk) begin\n        for (int i = 0; i < 8; i = i + 1) begin\n            d_reg[i] <= d[i];\n        end\n    end\n\n    // Output the current state of the D flip-flops\n    assign q = d_reg;\n\nendmodule\n```\n",
